<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Bahn 1996 group pretax profit 721 mln DM.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bahn 1996 group pretax profit 721 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pretax profit			721     vs 553</p>
<p>    Group sales				  30,200  vs 29,824</p>
<p>    Capital					13,125  vs 12,279</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total			57,935  vs 52,064</p>
<p>    Investments				  10,621  vs 10,131</p>
<p>    Cash flow				    3,882   vs 2,537</p>
<p>    Workforce (Dec 31)			 288,768 vs 312,579</p>
<p>    Parent sales				 24,100  vs 23,700</p>
<p>    Long-distance sales			5,400   vs 5,200</p>
<p>    Short-distance sales		     11,000  vs 10,600</p>
<p>    Freight sales				7,100   vs 7,600</p>
<p>    Parent investments			 14,400  vs 13,900</p>
<p>NOTE - German national railway Deutsche Bahn AG plans to boost sales while at least maintaining profit levels this year, chairman Heinz Duerr said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
